// extrasdrawer: the Extras Drawer (GetRoot().ExtrasDrawer), the system's
// launcher and package manager. It is a protoFinderWindow on the union
// "Packages" soup: an icon entry per installed application, book, form,
// soup or script (made for each new package's parts), tagged with its
// folder (labels) and ordered by sequence. It shows the icons of a folder
// (or the Unfiled Icons, or All Icons), opens them, and files, moves,
// deletes, freezes or thaws them and makes one the backdrop. It also has
// the volume and contrast sliders, a battery gauge, the Memory Info slip
// and the legal notice. Entries tagged '_buttonBar belong to the button
// bar (buttonBar).

